### AktarBilet REST Client Koleksiyonu (requests.http)
### DDO Yazılım Ekibi Şartnamesi — Bölüm 10 Elle Deneme Koleksiyonu

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@stamp = f85f26

### 1. Sistem Sağlık Uçları
GET {{baseUrl}}/health HTTP/1.1

### 2. Zorunlu Sistem Sağlık Ucu (System Canary: GET /_hz/f85f)
GET {{baseUrl}}/_hz/f85f HTTP/1.1

### 3. Prometheus Metrikleri
GET {{baseUrl}}/metrics HTTP/1.1

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. Kimlik Doğrulama (Tüm Roller İçin Demo Girişleri)
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 4.1. Admin / Canary Girişi (seed.sedir@ddo-case.invalid)
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "seed.sedir@ddo-case.invalid",
  "password": "SedirPassword2026!"
}

### 4.2. Yolcu Girişi
# @name loginYolcu
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "yolcu@aktarbilet.gov.tr",
  "password": "YolcuPassword123!"
}

### 4.3. Kontrolör Girişi
# @name loginKontrolor
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "kontrolor@aktarbilet.gov.tr",
  "password": "KontrolorPassword123!"
}

### 4.4. Muhasebe Girişi
# @name loginMuhasebe
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "muhasebe@aktarbilet.gov.tr",
  "password": "MuhasebePassword123!"
}

### 4.5. Operasyon Girişi
# @name loginOperasyon
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "operasyon@aktarbilet.gov.tr",
  "password": "OperasyonPassword123!"
}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 5. F-1: Kart ve Bakiye Yönetimi, Dolum
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 5.1. Kart Bakiye Sorgulama
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/cards/CARD_TAM_001 HTTP/1.1

### 5.2. Kart Hareket Defteri (Bonus 2: Yolcu Sorgulama)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/cards/CARD_TAM_001/ledger HTTP/1.1

### 5.3. Kart Bakiye Dolumu (Idempotent)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/cards/CARD_TAM_001/recharge HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: RECHARGE_REQ_101

{
  "amount_kurus": 10000,
  "description": "Kiosk Dolumu 100 TL"
}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 6. F-2 / T-1 / T-2: Validatör Olayları & Çevrimdışı Senkronizasyon
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 6.1. Turnike Biniş Olayı (İlk Biniş - Tam Tarife: 20 TL)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/validators/tap HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: TAP_EVENT_001

{
  "validator_id": "VAL_500T_01",
  "sequence_no": 1,
  "card_id": "CARD_TAM_001",
  "line_id": "LINE_500T",
  "station_id": "STAT_AYRILIK",
  "direction": 1,
  "tapped_at": "2026-10-24T14:00:00Z"
}

### 6.2. 1. Aktarma (25 dk sonra farklı hatta biniş -> %50 İndirim: 10 TL)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/validators/tap HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: TAP_EVENT_002

{
  "validator_id": "VAL_14ES_01",
  "sequence_no": 2,
  "card_id": "CARD_TAM_001",
  "line_id": "LINE_14ES",
  "station_id": "STAT_KADIKOY",
  "direction": 1,
  "tapped_at": "2026-10-24T14:25:00Z"
}

### 6.3. Ters Yön Kuralı (Aynı hatta geri dönüş aktarma sayılmaz -> Tam Ücret)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/validators/tap HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: TAP_EVENT_003

{
  "validator_id": "VAL_14ES_01",
  "sequence_no": 3,
  "card_id": "CARD_TAM_001",
  "line_id": "LINE_14ES",
  "station_id": "STAT_AYRILIK",
  "direction": 2,
  "tapped_at": "2026-10-24T14:40:00Z"
}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 7. F-3: Hat, Durak ve Tarifeler
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/lines HTTP/1.1

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/stations HTTP/1.1

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tariffs HTTP/1.1

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 8. F-5 / T-4: Gelir Paylaşımı ve Dönem Kapanışı
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 8.1. Dönem Kapatma
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/settlements/close HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "period_id": "a0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001"
}

### 8.2. Kapanış Sonrası Storno / Düzeltme Kaydı
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/settlements/storno HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "period_id": "a0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "operator": "ozel_halk",
  "amount_kurus": -500,
  "reason": "Geçersiz okuma düzeltmesi"
}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 9. F-6: Saha Kontrol ve Ceza
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/penalties HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "card_id": "CARD_TAM_001",
  "line_id": "LINE_500T",
  "station_id": "STAT_AYRILIK",
  "penalty_amount_kurus": 5000,
  "reason": "kartsiz_binis",
  "notes": "Turnikeden kaçak geçiş denemesi"
}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 10. Bonus 1 & 3: Isı Haritası ve Tarife Simülasyonu
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 10.1. Hat Bazlı Doluluk Isı Haritası (Bonus 1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reports/heatmap HTTP/1.1

### 10.2. Tarife Değişikliği Etki Simülasyonu (Bonus 3)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/simulation/fare-impact HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "base_fare_change_pct": 15.0,
  "student_fare_change_pct": 25.0,
  "elasticity_factor": -0.35
}
